# The ghost: what the tool would make at the target, see-through; a house turned with Select (and R2, L2), a mill,
# a road joining the main road, then a house red where it may not go (on the road).
tp 12 61
wait 10
key X
hold DOWN+RIGHT 2
tool house
wait 3
shot c00-house
key SELECT
wait 3
shot c01-house-turned
key R2
wait 3
shot c02-house-turned2
key L2
key L2
key L2
wait 3
shot c03-house-back
tool mill
wait 3
shot c04-mill
tool road
hold DOWN+LEFT 2
wait 3
shot c05-road-joins
tool house
hold DOWN+LEFT 2
hold DOWN 2
wait 3
shot c06-house-refused
